Z||000001||My7Fieros||10-14-2001||12:55 AM||||To my knowledge...<BR>1.no<BR>2.no<BR>3.no<P>Alot of people on here have been bashing the Fiero store recently due to the Rodney Dickman thing....<BR>I personally have bought lots of things from the Fiero store and have been happy w/everything I bought from them. I've bought things from Rodney Dickman to and have been happy w/ his products to. I'll continue to buy from both.<BR>(Sorry, I know that's kinda off topic, but Ive been wanting to say that due to the recent threads.)<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/My7logo_1.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||danny boy||10-14-2001||01:04 AM||||I don't think so. I was there once(at their warehouse) and didn't see one Fiero. There was one Badass Buick GN though that belonged to a guy that worked there.<BR> I think they're a good but expensive source for NOS and reproduction parts, but I'll never buy anything performance oriented from them.||||reg||1
